<section class="route setup-page" data-route-view data-route-key="setup">
  <header class="setup-heading"><span class="experience-eyebrow">WELCOME TO SYNERGY</span><h1>Make room for your next idea.</h1><p>Set up your workspace once. You can change every preference and connection later.</p></header>
  <div class="setup-layout">
    <ol class="setup-progress" aria-label="Setup progress"><% for (const [index,id,label,detail] of [[1,'welcome','Your workspace','A name and a starting point'],[2,'connections','Connect your tools','AI providers and accounts'],[3,'preferences','Set your defaults','Appearance and research'],[4,'review','Ready to explore','Review and get started']]) { %><li data-setup-progress="<%= id %>"><span><%= index %></span><div><strong><%= label %></strong><small><%= detail %></small></div></li><% } %></ol>
    <div class="setup-content">
      <p class="setup-feedback" data-setup-feedback role="status">Loading your workspace…</p>
      <form data-setup-welcome data-setup-step="welcome">
        <span class="setup-step-label">STEP 1 OF 4</span><h2>How will you use Synergy?</h2><p>Start with what interests you. All workspaces will still be available.</p>
        <label class="field">Display name<input name="displayName" maxlength="80" autocomplete="nickname" value="<%= page.operator?.displayName || page.operator?.username || '' %>" placeholder="Your name" required></label>
        <fieldset class="interest-choices"><legend>I'm here for…</legend><% for (const [id,label] of [['research','AI research'],['prediction-markets','Prediction markets'],['stocks','Stocks & accounts'],['practice','Forward paper trading'],['automation','External AI assistants']]) { %><label><input type="checkbox" name="interests" value="<%= id %>"><span><%= label %></span></label><% } %></fieldset>
        <div class="setup-actions"><button class="btn btn-solid" type="submit" disabled>Continue to connections →</button></div>
      </form>
      <section data-setup-step="connections" hidden>
        <span class="setup-step-label">STEP 2 OF 4</span><h2>Bring your tools together.</h2><p>Add the connections you need now. You can explore markets and practice without connecting a live account.</p>
        <form class="setup-connection" data-setup-ai><div class="connection-card-heading"><span class="provider-mark">AI</span><div><h3>An AI provider</h3><p>Power your research assistant.</p></div></div><div class="settings-fields"><label class="field">Provider<select name="provider"><option value="gemini">Gemini</option><option value="openai">OpenAI / Codex</option><option value="claude">Claude</option><option value="grok">Grok</option></select></label><label class="field">API key<input type="password" name="apiKey" maxlength="8192" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Paste your provider API key" required></label></div><p data-setup-ai-status>Your key is encrypted. Saving it does not make a paid AI call.</p><button class="btn" type="submit" disabled>Save provider key</button><p data-setup-ai-feedback class="provider-feedback" role="status"></p></form>
        <section class="setup-connection"><div class="connection-card-heading"><span class="provider-mark">R</span><div><h3>Robinhood</h3><p>Connect your existing brokerage account.</p></div><span class="connection-state" data-setup-robinhood-status>Checking…</span></div><p data-setup-robinhood-detail>Checking connection availability…</p><button class="btn" type="button" data-setup-robinhood-connect disabled>Connect Robinhood ↗</button><p data-setup-robinhood-feedback class="provider-feedback" role="status"></p></section>
        <form class="setup-connection" data-setup-poly><div class="connection-card-heading"><span class="provider-mark">P</span><div><h3>Polymarket US</h3><p>Read your account balances and positions.</p></div><span class="connection-state" data-setup-poly-status>Checking…</span></div><p>Use your API key ID and secret key from your Polymarket US account. Your sign-in password is never needed.</p><details><summary>Add Polymarket US credentials</summary><div class="settings-fields"><label class="field">API key ID<input name="keyId" maxlength="200" autocomplete="off" required></label><label class="field">Secret key<input type="password" name="secretKey" maxlength="8192" autocomplete="new-password" required></label></div><button class="btn" type="submit" disabled>Connect and verify</button></details><p data-setup-poly-feedback class="provider-feedback" role="status"></p></form>
        <div class="setup-actions"><button class="btn" type="button" data-setup-back="welcome">Back</button><button class="btn btn-solid" type="button" data-setup-next="preferences">Continue →</button></div><p class="setup-footnote">Connections are optional. Access to paid models and live trading also depends on this server's configuration.</p>
      </section>
      <form data-setup-preferences data-setup-step="preferences" hidden><span class="setup-step-label">STEP 3 OF 4</span><h2>Start with comfortable defaults.</h2><p>These settings apply to new research. Practice balances and live accounts are configured separately.</p><div class="settings-fields"><label class="field">Appearance<select name="theme"><option value="system">Follow my device</option><option value="light">Light</option><option value="dark">Dark</option></select></label><label class="field">Start page<select name="defaultLanding"><option value="/home">Overview</option><option value="/research">Research desk</option><option value="/practice">Practice lab</option><option value="/live">Live workspace</option></select></label><label class="field">Time zone<input name="timezone" required maxlength="80" placeholder="America/Chicago"></label><label class="field">Research symbol<input name="symbol" maxlength="24" required placeholder="SPY"></label><label class="field">Timeframe<select name="timeframe"><% for(const value of ['1m','5m','15m','1h','4h','1d']) { %><option value="<%= value %>"><%= value %></option><% } %></select></label><label class="field">Risk per research idea (%)<input name="riskPercent" type="number" min="0.01" max="5" step="0.01" required><small>A sizing input for research; it does not authorize trading.</small></label></div><div class="setup-actions"><button class="btn" type="button" data-setup-back="connections">Back</button><button class="btn btn-solid" type="submit">Review my workspace →</button></div></form>
      <form data-setup-review data-setup-step="review" hidden><span class="setup-step-label">STEP 4 OF 4</span><h2>Your workspace is ready to explore.</h2><p data-setup-review-summary></p><div class="environment-choices"><article class="environment-card environment-practice"><span>VIRTUAL FUNDS</span><h3>Practice lab</h3><p>Follow live market prices and place virtual orders with their own balances, history, and results.</p></article><article class="environment-card environment-live"><span>REAL ACCOUNTS</span><h3>Live workspace</h3><p>Connect brokerage accounts, review current holdings, and manage real orders where enabled.</p></article></div><label class="preference-toggle setup-acknowledgement"><input type="checkbox" name="acknowledgedPracticeIsolation" required><span><strong>I understand practice and live trading are separate.</strong><small>Practice results do not place trades or move money in my connected accounts.</small></span></label><div class="setup-actions"><button class="btn" type="button" data-setup-back="preferences">Back</button><button class="btn btn-solid" type="submit">Open my workspace →</button></div></form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
